title: PamStealer Wavel Variant C2 Key Exchange - wavel.apple03cloudstore.com
id: a1630d8d-4f7a-404f-b6bb-5823b719906c
status: experimental
description: Detects network connections to wavel.apple03cloudstore[.]com, the X25519 key-exchange command server of the PamStealer Wavel-variant macOS infostealer whose payload is decrypted live from C2 so it cannot be recovered statically (Jamf Threat Labs disclosure, September 22, 2026).
references:
  - https://thehackernews.com/2026/09/pamstealer-macos-malware-adds-live-c2.html
  - https://www.jamf.com/blog/pamstealer-wavel-macos-infostealer/
  - https://cyberworldops.eu/en/pamstealer-makes-macos-payload-recovery-depend-on-its-command-server
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026-09-27
tags:
  - attack.t1573
  - attack.t1105
logsource:
  category: network_connection
  product: windows
detection:
  selection_c2:
    DestinationHostname|endswith: 'wavel.apple03cloudstore.com'
  condition: selection_c2
falsepositives:
  - None expected for the registered attacker domain; only security tooling that resolves the indicator would match
level: high
